  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "By using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4867792006ed7783b3e593997df0276db6752016c5135b807b7b1f0b11f0d47a.png] \n\nGiven: 25 * 5 * 6 * 15 * 3 * 50\n\nBy checking options and substituting accordingly,\n\n(1) ×, ÷, +, –, = \n\n⇒ 25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 15 - 3 = 50\n\nLHS = 25 × 5 ÷ 6 + 15 - 3\n\n= 25 × 0.833 + 15 - 3\n\n= 20.825 + 15 - 3\n\n= 35.825 - 3\n\n= 32.825\n\n≠ 50\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**(2) +, ×, –, ÷, =**\n\n**⇒ 25 + 5 × 6 - 15 ÷ 3 = 50**\n\n**LHS = 25 + 5 × 6 - 15 ÷ 3**\n\n**= 25 + 5 × 6 - 5**\n\n**= 25 + 30 - 5**\n\n**= 55 - 5**\n\n**= 50**\n\n**LHS = RHS **\n\n(3) ×, +, ÷, –, = \n\n⇒ 25 × 5 + 6 ÷ 15 - 3 = 50\n\nLHS = 25 × 5 + 6 ÷ 15 - 3\n\n= 25 × 5 + 0.4 - 3\n\n= 125 + 0.4 - 3\n\n= 122.4\n\n≠ 50\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n(4) ÷, ×, –, +, =\n\n⇒ 25 ÷ 5 × 6 - 15 + 3 = 50\n\nLHS = 25 ÷ 5 × 6 - 15 + 3\n\n= 5 × 6 - 15 + 3\n\n= 30 - 15 + 3\n\n= 33 - 15\n\n= 18\n\n≠ 50\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, **+, ×, -, ÷, = **is the correct answer.",
